// Returns the number of tags the subtree uses (`0` or more: the next tag of the caller is
// `tag_base` plus it), or a negative status, and then writes nothing: [`FERRO_NOT_FOUND`] when
// the root has no such element (nothing is recorded; the caller writes the element in full),
// or [`FERRO_WRONG_THREAD`](crate::FERRO_WRONG_THREAD) off the UI thread. Commit the frame
// under the same root, before another commit under it. UI thread only.
